menuconfig TOMAHAWK56_LAYER_RGB
    bool "Tomahawk56 per-key layer lighting"
    default y
    depends on ZMK_RGB_UNDERGLOW
    help
      Use the Tomahawk56's 28 addressable LEDs as a persistent per-key
      layer map with Dygma Defy-inspired colors.

config TOMAHAWK56_STUDIO_RESET_ON_FLASH
    bool "Drop the saved ZMK Studio keymap when new firmware is flashed"
    default y
    depends on ZMK_KEYMAP_SETTINGS_STORAGE
    help
      Bindings saved from ZMK Studio live in the settings partition and
      override the compiled keymap on every boot, which a reflash cannot
      undo. With this enabled the board notices the first boot of a
      newly built image and drops those saved bindings, so a flash always
      leaves it running exactly what was built. Bluetooth pairings and
      every other setting are left alone.
